WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Where were you all this time?

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.500
I'm so happy to see you. Thank you for coming!

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.000
I'm so sorry... I miss him so much.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.500
Wow! We did it! I can't believe it!

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.500
The meeting is at three o'clock in the conference room.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.500
GET OUT OF MY HOUSE!
